A walk around the old Butetown. Many wonderful buildings which used to alive with coal and stocks trading.
The Coal Exchange, a building which was very much under threat until recently. Was a popular music venue later on in its life. Where the first million pound cheque in the world was signed in 1904. Now the Exchange Hotel and restoration continues.

